'''Gifts''' are special items that can be opened. This is done by right clicking another player and having the other player right-click the placed gift. When opening, both players will receive one of the same rewards from that gift.

== Obtaining ==
All '''Gifts''' are purchasable at the [[Bazaar]], can be mined out of the walls of the {{Zone|Glacial Cave}} (excluding Party Gift), and are also rewards for successfully guarding the Gift Piles during [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]].

=== [[White Gift]]s ({{Common}}) ===
{{main|White Gift}}
* {{Green|20}} can be found hidden around the map of {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.
* As drops from {{MobSprite|Frozen Steve}}, {{MobSprite|Frosty}}, {{MobSprite|Grinch}} and {{MobSprite|Reindrake}}.
* One can be obtained every SkyBlock Year from {{NPCSprite|St. Jerry}} by having him as an [[Abiphone|Abiphone contact]] and calling him.

=== [[Green Gift]]s ({{Uncommon}}) ===
{{main|Green Gift}}
* One is obtained from {{NPCSprite|St. Jerry}} as a reward after collecting the {{Green|20}} white gifts at [[Jerry's Workshop]].
* As a drop from {{MobSprite|Grinch}} and {{MobSprite|Reindrake}}.

=== [[Red Gift]]s ({{Rare}}) ===
{{main|Red Gift}}
* From completing the first section of the [[Chicken Race]] (Obtainable once per [[profile]]).
* Can be generated by {{Item|Krampus Helmet}} as an upgrade item for minions.
* As a drop from {{MobSprite|Frosty}}, {{MobSprite|Grinch}}, {{MobSprite|Yeti}}, {{MobSprite|Nutcracker}} and {{MobSprite|Reindrake}}.

=== [[Party Gift]] ===
{{main|Party Gift}}
Party Gifts can only be obtained while {{NPCSprite|Foxy}}'s {{Green|A Time For Giving}} perk is active.
* As a drop from any [[Winter Sea Creatures]].
