== Tips ==
*{{Item|Snowman Mask}}, {{Item|White Gift Talisman}} [[Accessory]] line, {{Item|Snowfin Shard}} and the Professional Gifter perk from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} give more rewards from '''Gifts'''.
*{{Item|Snow Suit Armor|text=Snow Suit}} (including equipment) and {{Item|Nutcracker Armor}}, {{Item|Reindeer Pet}}, {{Item|Hideongift Shard}}, the Season of Joy perk from [[Ice Essence Shop]] and the Present Connoisseur perk from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} grant more '''Gifts''' from the [[Season of Jerry]] event.

== Trivia ==
* When a "Santa" rarity gift drop is received, it will be announced in the public chat as a "{{mctxt|c|bold=true|SANTA GIFT!}}"
* The {{Item|Golden Gift}}, even though it is named "gift," cannot be opened. It can only be used to purchase the {{Item|Gold Gift Talisman}}.
* On {{gamemode|Ironman}} mode, the player can only receive gifts from other Ironman players (and Bingo players), but they can give gifts to any player except Bingo players.
** Similarly, on a {{gamemode|Bingo}} profile, receiving gifts is only possible from other Bingo profiles, but gifts may be given to any other player.
* Attempting to send a gift to a mob will make the chat say 'Click a player to gift them! This isn't a player!'

